            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Build the timeline from supplied evidence. Separate direct observations from causal conclusions supported by the verified fix. Tie one preventive action to the demonstrated cause, naming an accountable owner and a completion check.",
